   [33]={next_id=34, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="莱弗尔生物综合研究院      玛尔斯", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_703.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, page_show_effect={ 0.20, 0, 5, 0, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 873.00, 341.00, 1.00, {}, {}, 1.00}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [34]={next_id=35, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="莱弗尔生物综合研究院……那不是深海如今供职的地方吗？不对……深海是在莱弗尔生命科学研究院。", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="玩家名字", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_703.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [35]={next_id=36, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="还有玛尔斯这个名字……", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="玩家名字", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_703.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [36]={next_id=37, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="1999年\n今天是我的四十岁生日，我发掘了一个好苗子，她叫丽娜，是个刚刚毕业的年轻人，有望成为我的继承人，研究院那帮老东西真不识货。\n老院长向我递出了橄榄枝，我应该接受吗？\n", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_703.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, page_show_effect={ 0.20, 0, 5, 0, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 873.00, 341.00, 1.00, {}, {}, 1.00}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [37]={next_id=38, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="2020年\n■■■的那帮蠢人也不是满脑子怪物，派了一个叫维里塔的小孩来跟我谈合作，我不会轻易将自己的位置交出去的。\n听说她下一站是尤赞坦，可笑，尤赞坦那帮蠢货。", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_703.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, page_show_effect={ 0.20, 0, 5, 0, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 873.00, 341.00, 1.00, {}, {}, 1.00}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [38]={next_id=39, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="2023年\n近距离见到了锚点降临，那才是我所渴望获得的力量，我所掌控的天使会不会有一天也能到这种程度？我很期待丽娜能继续我的研究。", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_703.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, page_show_effect={ 0.20, 0, 5, 0, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 873.00, 341.00, 1.00, {}, {}, 1.00}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [39]={next_id=40, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="2029年\n该死，维里塔居然还活着，她还敢反击，我亲爱的■■■报废了，修好她的代价有些过于高昂。\n我今年的运气不太好。", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_703.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, page_show_effect={ 0.20, 0, 5, 0, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 873.00, 341.00, 1.00, {}, {}, 1.00}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [40]={next_id=41, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="2030年\n尤赞坦政变，伊南姆家族掌权，维里塔被处决。\n老院长死了，而我明天接任她的位置。\n今天是个好日子。", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_703.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, page_show_effect={ 0.20, 0, 5, 0, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 873.00, 341.00, 1.00, {}, {}, 1.00}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [41]={next_id=42, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="2031年\n我派去的人并没有找到维里塔留下的东西，那些资料仿佛从来没有出现过。\n伊南姆这些蠢人也会想要■■■的秘密吗？高阶文明可容不下他们窥视。", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_703.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, page_show_effect={ 0.20, 0, 5, 0, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 873.00, 341.00, 1.00, {}, {}, 1.00}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [42]={next_id=43, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="2035年\n有人向我告发，说丽娜想要背叛我……呵呵，她跟了我快四十年了，没有人会接纳她的，即使背叛也无处可去。\n倒是最近总有人想要让我下台，研究院这群小孩迟早为自己的狂妄付出代价。\n尤赞坦发生了政变，也许丽娜是看到了这个机会。\n\n莱斯坦斯的发展倒是出乎我意料了，可以试着接触。\n战员这个定位听起来有点意思。", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_703.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, page_show_effect={ 0.20, 0, 5, 0, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 873.00, 341.00, 1.00, {}, {}, 1.00}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [43]={next_id=44, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="2040年\n■■■还没有销毁，现在在约瑟伯格。\n丽娜已经不听我的话了，她有自己的秘密。\n无论哪个国家，都没有位置给她，她都六十岁了，谁会让一个老太太上台主事呢？", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_703.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, page_show_effect={ 0.20, 0, 5, 0, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 873.00, 341.00, 1.00, {}, {}, 1.00}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [44]={next_id=45, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="笔记到这里没有了，后面是大片的空白页。", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_703.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [45]={next_id=46, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="从她的名字和这些文字你大概判断出了这个人的身份——莱弗尔生物综合研究院的最后一任院长。", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_703.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [46]={next_id=47, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="她死于2040年，具体死因被当局封锁，在她死后，早就人心涣散的莱弗尔生物综合研究院彻底分崩离析，一大批研究员失踪，遗留的研究成果流落泰诺星各地，并在不同程度上促进了各地的机械发展。", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_703.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [47]={next_id=48, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="后来在部分研究人员的努力下，由约瑟伯格官方出面进行重组，才有了如今的莱弗尔生命科学研究院。", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_703.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [48]={next_id=49, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="（但是这些东西为什么会出现在这里……这个明显与学术研究格格不入的地方……）", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="玩家名字", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_703.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [49]={next_id=50, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="你思考着，小心地将这个笔记本放回原位，然后把拍下的这些信息发送给了正在路上的深海。", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_703.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [50]={next_id=-1, abreast_id={51}, pType =2, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="外面传来一阵刹车声，紧接着一下子亮堂了起来，似乎有人搬着什么重物在往这边走。", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_703.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
